ravatar.com/avatar/d9630b236fc9bfd742596a4b747ff0c5?s=16&#038;d=monsterid&#038;r=g\' srcset=\'https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/d9630b236fc9bfd742596a4b747ff0c5?s=32&#038;d=monsterid&#038;r=g 2x\' class=\'avatar avatar-16 photo\' height=\'16\' width=\'16\' loading=\'lazy\'/></a><a href=\"https://profiles.wordpress.org/huongtraquan65/\" class=\"reviewer-name\">huongtraquan65</a> op <span class=\"review-date\">december 9, 2021</span>			</p>\n		</div>\n	</div>\n	<div class=\"review-body\">Great!</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"review\">\n	<div class=\"review-head\">\n		<div class=\"reviewer-info\">\n			<div class=\"review-title-section\">\n				<h4 class=\"review-title\">Excellent support to resolve my first question</h4>\n				<div class=\"star-rating\">\n				<div class=\"wporg-ratings\" aria-label=\"5 van de 5 sterren\" data-title-template=\"%s van de 5 sterren\" data-rating=\"5\" style=\"color:#ffb900;\"><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"></span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"></span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"></span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"></span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"></span></div>				</div>\n			</div>\n			<p class=\"reviewer\">\n				Door <a href=\"https://profiles.wordpress.org/vicdeming/\"><img alt=\'\' src=\'https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/51f6a79d65884ca1869a2af099994287?s=16&#038;d=monsterid&#038;r=g\' srcset=\'https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/51f6a79d65884ca1869a2af099994287?s=32&#038;d=monsterid&#038;r=g 2x\' class=\'avatar avatar-16 photo\' height=\'16\' width=\'16\' loading=\'lazy\'/></a><a href=\"https://profiles.wordpress.org/vicdeming/\" class=\"reviewer-name\">vicdeming</a> op <span class=\"review-date\">december 8, 2021</span>			</p>\n		</div>\n	</div>\n	<div class=\"review-body\">Patiently guided me to the source of my own ineptness.\nVery promising start for me with such a vital plugin which I must better understand to provide higher quality solutions for my customer base.</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"review\">\n	<div class=\"review-head\">\n		<div class=\"reviewer-info\">\n			<div class=\"review-title-section\">\n				<h4 class=\"review-title\">Excellent plugin but need help</h4>\n				<div class=\"star-rating\">\n				<div class=\"wporg-ratings\" aria-label=\"5 van de 5 sterren\" data-title-template=\"%s van de 5 sterren\" data-rating=\"5\" style=\"color:#ffb900;\"><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"></span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"></span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"></span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"></span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"></span></div>				</div>\n			</div>\n			<p class=\"reviewer\">\n				Door <a href=\"https://profiles.wordpress.org/natelvl/\"><img alt=\'\' src=\'https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/e9c26e21673a656444fde4aac5c06704?s=16&#038;d=monsterid&#038;r=g\' srcset=\'https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/e9c26e21673a656444fde4aac5c06704?s=32&#038;d=monsterid&#038;r=g 2x\' class=\'avatar avatar-16 photo\' height=\'16\' width=\'16\' loading=\'lazy\'/></a><a href=\"https://profiles.wordpress.org/natelvl/\" class=\"reviewer-name\">natelvl</a> op <span class=\"review-date\">november 29, 2021</span>			</p>\n		</div>\n	</div>\n	<div class=\"review-body\">Hi,\n\nNo need to explain why this plugin is extraordinary, but I have a question. I\'m creating a shop with product categories and in a specific category I put a button on the product page. This button has to change the product categories of this product. So my question is: which function can add a product category to a product and remove the current category ?\n\nThanks for your answer</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"review\">\n	<div class=\"review-head\">\n		<div class=\"reviewer-info\">\n			<div class=\"review-title-section\">\n				<h4 class=\"review-title\">Simply the best e-commerce plugin!</h4>\n				<div class=\"star-rating\">\n				<div class=\"wporg-ratings\" aria-label=\"5 van de 5 sterren\" data-title-template=\"%s van de 5 sterren\" data-rating=\"5\" style=\"color:#ffb900;\"><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"></span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"></span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"></span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"></span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"></span></div>				</div>\n			</div>\n			<p class=\"reviewer\">\n				Door <a href=\"https://profiles.wordpress.org/tigroumeow/\"><img alt=\'\' src=\'https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/d21b79989071bd6ed38a9f11f9cd5a76?s=16&#038;d=monsterid&#038;r=g\' srcset=\'https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/d21b79989071bd6ed38a9f11f9cd5a76?s=32&#038;d=monsterid&#038;r=g 2x\' class=\'avatar avatar-16 photo\' height=\'16\' width=\'16\' loading=\'lazy\'/></a><a href=\"https://profiles.wordpress.org/tigroumeow/\" class=\"reviewer-name\">Jordy Meow <small>(TigrouMeow)</small></a> op <span class=\"review-date\">november 28, 2021</span>			</p>\n		</div>\n	</div>\n	<div class=\"review-body\">Not only the best e-commerce plugin, but also the best plugin made by Automattic! I wished JetPack was as clean as WooCommerce...</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"review\">\n	<div class=\"review-head\">\n		<div class=\"reviewer-info\">\n			<div class=\"review-title-section\">\n				<h4 class=\"review-title\">its good</h4>\n				<div class=\"star-rating\">\n				<div class=\"wporg-ratings\" aria-label=\"5 van de 5 sterren\" data-title-template=\"%s van de 5 sterren\" data-rating=\"5\" style=\"color:#ffb900;\"><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"></span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"></span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"></span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"></span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"></span></div>				</div>\n			</div>\n			<p class=\"reviewer\">\n				Door <a href=\"https://profiles.wordpress.org/ammarishtiaq999/\"><img alt=\'\' src=\'https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/cd0b3de82f55e68a2c9d46dea736eb6f?s=16&#038;d=monsterid&#038;r=g\' srcset=\'https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/cd0b3de82f55e68a2c9d46dea736eb6f?s=32&#038;d=monsterid&#038;r=g 2x\' class=\'avatar avatar-16 photo\' height=\'16\' width=\'16\' loading=\'lazy\'/></a><a href=\"https://profiles.wordpress.org/ammarishtiaq999/\" class=\"reviewer-name\">ammarishtiaq999</a> op <span class=\"review-date\">november 26, 2021</span>			</p>\n		</div>\n	</div>\n	<div class=\"review-body\">it\'s impressive</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"review\">\n	<div class=\"review-head\">\n		<div class=\"reviewer-info\">\n			<div class=\"review-title-section\">\n				<h4 class=\"review-title\">Hot garbage</h4>\n				<div class=\"star-rating\">\n				<div class=\"wporg-ratings\" aria-label=\"1 van de 5 sterren\" data-title-template=\"%s van de 5 sterren\" data-rating=\"1\" style=\"color:#ffb900;\"><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"></span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-empty\"></span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-empty\"></span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-empty\"></span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-empty\"></span></div>				</div>\n			</div>\n			<p class=\"reviewer\">\n				Door <a href=\"https://profiles.wordpress.org/imaginarymedia/\"><img alt=\'\' src=\'https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/71ff0c211003b1f58576c793d92ca201?s=16&#038;d=monsterid&#038;r=g\' srcset=\'https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/71ff0c211003b1f58576c793d92ca201?s=32&#038;d=monsterid&#038;r=g 2x\' class=\'avatar avatar-16 photo\' height=\'16\' width=\'16\' loading=\'lazy\'/></a><a href=\"https://profiles.wordpress.org/imaginarymedia/\" class=\"reviewer-name\">James Robinson <small>(imaginarymedia)</small></a> op <span class=\"review-date\">november 25, 2021</span>			</p>\n		</div>\n	</div>\n	<div class=\"review-body\">Navigating to the WooCommerce dashboard is essentially broken as it attempts and fails to load an Inbox that I don\'t want or need. The plugin is rife with PHP warnings. And for something that feels so needlessly bloated and slow, it offers very little in the way of features.</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"review\">\n	<div class=\"review-head\">\n		<div class=\"reviewer-info\">\n			<div class=\"review-title-section\">\n				<h4 class=\"review-title\">works just fine</h4>\n				<div class=\"star-rating\">\n				<div class=\"wporg-ratings\" aria-label=\"5 van de 5 sterren\" data-title-template=\"%s van de 5 sterren\" data-rating=\"5\" style=\"color:#ffb900;\"><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"></span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"></span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"></span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"></span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"></span></div>				</div>\n			</div>\n			<p class=\"reviewer\">\n				Door <a href=\"https://profiles.wordpress.org/ullivilli/\"><img alt=\'\' src=\'https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/8752e7423b9d4914105d25f514dda795?s=16&#038;d=monsterid&#038;r=g\' srcset=\'https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/8752e7423b9d4914105d25f514dda795?s=32&#038;d=monsterid&#038;r=g 2x\' class=\'avatar avatar-16 photo\' height=\'16\' width=\'16\' loading=\'lazy\'/></a><a href=\"https://profiles.wordpress.org/ullivilli/\" class=\"reviewer-name\">ullivilli</a> op <span class=\"review-date\">november 23, 2021</span>			</p>\n		</div>\n	</div>\n	<div class=\"review-body\">If you don\'t need anything stupid this is the easiest and cheapest way to get a shop running.</div>\n</div>\n\";}s:13:\"download_link\";s:60:\"https://downloads.wordpress.org/plugin/woocommerce.6.0.0.zip\";s:11:\"screenshots\";a:6:{i:1;a:2:{s:3:\"src\";s:64:\"https://ps.w.org/woocommerce/assets/screenshot-1.jpg?rev=2366418\";s:7:\"caption\";b:0;}i:2;a:2:{s:3:\"src\";s:64:\"https://ps.w.org/woocommerce/assets/screenshot