0.zip\";s:5:\"2.6.1\";s:56:\"https://downloads.wordpress.org/plugin/bbpress.2.6.1.zip\";s:5:\"2.6.2\";s:56:\"https://downloads.wordpress.org/plugin/bbpress.2.6.2.zip\";s:5:\"2.6.3\";s:56:\"https://downloads.wordpress.org/plugin/bbpress.2.6.3.zip\";s:5:\"2.6.4\";s:56:\"https://downloads.wordpress.org/plugin/bbpress.2.6.4.zip\";s:5:\"2.6.5\";s:56:\"https://downloads.wordpress.org/plugin/bbpress.2.6.5.zip\";s:5:\"2.6.6\";s:56:\"https://downloads.wordpress.org/plugin/bbpress.2.6.6.zip\";s:5:\"2.6.7\";s:56:\"https://downloads.wordpress.org/plugin/bbpress.2.6.7.zip\";s:5:\"2.6.8\";s:56:\"https://downloads.wordpress.org/plugin/bbpress.2.6.8.zip\";s:5:\"2.6.9\";s:56:\"https://downloads.wordpress.org/plugin/bbpress.2.6.9.zip\";s:5:\"trunk\";s:50:\"https://downloads.wordpress.org/plugin/bbpress.zip\";}s:11:\"donate_link\";s:0:\"\";s:7:\"banners\";a:2:{s:3:\"low\";s:61:\"https://ps.w.org/bbpress/assets/banner-772x250.png?rev=478663\";s:4:\"high\";s:62:\"https://ps.w.org/bbpress/assets/banner-1544x500.png?rev=567403\";}}s:14:\"contact-form-7\";a:25:{s:4:\"name\";s:14:\"Contact Form 7\";s:4:\"slug\";s:14:\"contact-form-7\";s:7:\"version\";s:5:\"5.5.3\";s:6:\"author\";s:62:\"<a href=\"https://ideasilo.wordpress.com/\">Takayuki Miyoshi</a>\";s:14:\"author_profile\";s:44:\"https://profiles.wordpress.org/takayukister/\";s:12:\"contributors\";a:1:{s:12:\"takayukister\";a:3:{s:7:\"profile\";s:44:\"https://profiles.wordpress.org/takayukister/\";s:6:\"avatar\";s:88:\"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/bb7bc21850c77e9eb16b44102f4a539d?s=96&d=monsterid&r=g\";s:12:\"display_name\";s:16:\"Takayuki Miyoshi\";}}s:8:\"requires\";s:3:\"5.7\";s:6:\"tested\";s:5:\"5.8.2\";s:12:\"requires_php\";b:0;s:6:\"rating\";i:82;s:7:\"ratings\";a:5:{i:5;i:1336;i:4;i:134;i:3;i:60;i:2;i:50;i:1;i:344;}s:11:\"num_ratings\";i:1924;s:15:\"support_threads\";i:411;s:24:\"support_threads_resolved\";i:94;s:15:\"active_installs\";i:5000000;s:12:\"last_updated\";s:21:\"2021-11-28 3:55am GMT\";s:5:\"added\";s:10:\"2007-08-02\";s:8:\"homepage\";s:25:\"https://contactform7.com/\";s:8:\"sections\";a:6:{s:11:\"description\";s:3230:\"<p>Met Contact Form 7 kan men meerdere contactformulieren beheren en heeft men de mogelijkheid het formulier en de e-mailberichten flexibel met eenvoudige opmaak aan te passen. Het formulier ondersteunt Ajax-submit, CAPTCHA, Akismet-spamfilteren enzovoort.</p>\n<h4>Documenten en ondersteuning</h4>\n<p>Men kan uitgebreide <a href=\"https://contactform7.com/docs/\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">documentatie</a>, <a href=\"https://contactform7.com/faq/\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">FAQ</a> en gedetailleerdere informatie vinden over Contact Form 7 op <a href=\"https://contactform7.com/\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">contactform7.com</a>. Als je niet alle antwoorden kunt vinden in de documentatie, FAQ&#8217;s enz., dan kun je het <a href=\"https://wordpress.org/support/plugin/contact-form-7/\">supportforum</a> raadplegen op WordPress.org. Mochten er geen onderwerpen te vinden zijn die met je vraag te maken hebben, dan kun je een nieuw onderwerp plaatsen op het forum.</p>\n<h4>Contact Form 7 heeft je hulp nodig</h4>\n<p>Het is lastig de ontwikkeling en ondersteuning van deze gratis plugin voort te zetten zonder bijdragen van gebruikers als jij; als je met plezier gebruik maakt van Contact Form 7 en je de plugin handig vindt, overweeg dan een <a href=\"https://contactform7.com/donate/\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">donatie te doen</a>. Een donatie moedigt de toekomstige ontwikkeling aan en zorgt voor betere ondersteuning.</p>\n<h4>Privacymeldingen</h4>\n<p>Bij de standaardconfiguratie doet de plugin zelf het volgende niet:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>volg gebruikers heimelijk;</li>\n<li>schrijf alle persoonlijke gebruikersinformatie naar de database</li>\n<li>stuur data naar externe servers;</li>\n<li>Gebruik cookies.</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Als je bepaalde functies in deze plugin activeert, kan het contactformulier persoonlijke gegevens van invuller naar de serviceprovider sturen, inclusief het IP-adres; daarom is het aan te raden het privacybeleid van de provider te bevestigen. Deze functies omvatten:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>reCAPTCHA (<a href=\"https://policies.google.com/?hl=en\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">Google</a>)</li>\n<li>Akismet (<a href=\"https://automattic.com/privacy/\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">Automattic</a>)</li>\n<li>Constant Contact (<a href=\"https://www.endurance.com/privacy\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">Endurance International Group</a>)</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.sendinblue.com/legal/privacypolicy/\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">Sendinblue</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://stripe.com/privacy\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">Stripe</a></li>\n</ul>\n<h4>Aanbevolen plugins</h4>\n<p>De volgende plugins worden aanbevolen voor gebruikers van Contact Form 7:</p>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://wordpress.org/plugins/flamingo/\">Flamingo</a> door Takayuki Miyoshi &#8211; Met Flamingo is het mogelijk de met contactformulieren verstuurde berichten in de database op te slaan.</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://wordpress.org/plugins/bogo/\">Bogo</a> door Takayuki Miyoshi &#8211; Bogo is rechttoe-rechtaan meertalige plugin die geen hoofdpijn veroorzaakt.</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>Vertalingen</h4>\n<p>Je kunt <a href=\"https://contactform7.com/translating-contact-form-7/\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">Contactformulier 7 vertalen</a> op <a href=\"https://translate.wordpress.org/projects/wp-plugins/contact-form-7\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">translate.wordpress.org</a>.</p>\n\";s:12:\"installation\";s:450:\"<ol>\n<li>Upload de volledige <code>contact-form-7</code>-map naar de <code>/wp-content/plugins/</code>-directory.</li>\n<li>Activeer de plugin in het scherm <strong>Plugins</strong> (<strong>Plugins &gt; geïnstalleerde plugins</strong>).</li>\n</ol>\n<p>Je vindt het menu <strong>Contact</strong> in het WordPress-beheerdersscherm.</p>\n<p>Voor basaal gebruik kijk je op de <a href=\"https://contactform7.com/\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">plugin-website</a>.</p>\n\";s:3:\"faq\";s:469:\"<p>Heb je vragen of problemen met Contact Form 7, maak dan (verantwoord) gebruik van een van de volgende supportkanalen.</p>\n<ol>\n<li><a href=\"https://contactform7.com/docs/\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">Documentatie</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://contactform7.com/faq/\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">FAQ</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://wordpress.org/support/plugin/contact-form-7/\">Supportforum</a></li>\n</ol>\n<p><a href=\"https://contactform7.com/support/\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">Support</a></p>\n\";s:9:\"changelog\";s:1248:\"<p>Voor meer informatie, zie de <a href=\"https://contactform7.com/category/releases/\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">Versies</a></p>\n<h4>5.5.3</h4>\n<p><a href=\"https://contactform7.com/contact-form-7-553/\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">https://contactform7.com/contact-form-7-553/</a></p>\n<h4>5.5.2</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>REST API: verwijdert argument schema verwijzing die fouten veroorzaakt wanneer het formulier het veld &#8216;id&#8217; heeft.</li>\n<li>Wijzigt methodenamen die zijn gereserveerd in PHP 5.6.</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>5.5.1</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Opgelost: Gereserveerd trefwoord werd gebruikt in PHP klasse constante naam.</li>\n<li>Opgelost: Uncaught TypeError op <code>in_array()</code> afroep.</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>5.5</h4>\n<p><a href=\"https://contactform7.com/contact-form-7-55/\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">https://contactform7.com/contact-form-7-55/</a></p>\n<h4>5.4.2</h4>\n<p><a href=\"https://contactform7.com/contact-form-7-542/\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">https://contactform7.com/contact-form-7-542/</a></p>\n<h4>5.4.1</h4>\n<p><a href=\"https://contactform7.com/contact-form-7-541/\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">https://contactform7.com/contact-form-7-541/</a></p>\n<h4>5.4</h4>\n<p><a href=\"https://contactform7.com/contact-form-7-54/\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">https://contactform7.com/contact-form-7-54/</a></p>\n\";s:11:\"screenshots\";s:225:\"<ol><li><a href=\"https://ps.w.org/contact-form-7/assets/screenshot-1.png?rev=1176454\"><img src=\"https://ps.w.org/contact-form-7/assets/screenshot-1.png?rev=1176454\" alt=\"screenshot-1.png\"></a><p>screenshot-1.png</p></li></ol>\";s:7:\"reviews\";s:14904:\"<div class=\"review\">\n	<div class=\"review-head\">\n		<div class=\"reviewer-info\">\n			<div class=\"review-title-section\">\n				<h4 class=\"review-title\">Super simples, funcional e eficiente</h4>\n				<div class=\"star-rating\">\n				<div class=\"wporg-ratings\" aria-label=\"5 van de 5 sterren\" data-title-template=\"%s van de 5 sterren\" data-rating=\"5\" style=\"color:#ffb900;\"><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"></span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"></span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"></span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"></span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"></span></div>				</div>\n			</div>\n			<p class=\"reviewer\">\n				Door <a href=\"https://profiles.wordpress.org/sandroacv/\"><img alt=\'\' src=\'https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/aca581624e47e23bc2ecd148b0dc81c0?s=16&#038;d=monsterid&#038;r=g\' srcset=\'https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/aca581624e47e23bc2ecd148b0dc81c0?s=32&#038;d=monsterid&#038;r=g 2x\' class=\'avatar avatar-16 photo\' height=\'16\' width=\'16\' loading=\'lazy\'/></a><a href=\"https://profiles.wordpress.org/sandroacv/\" class=\"reviewer-name\">sandroacv</a> op <span class=\"review-date\">december 15, 2021</span>			</p>\n		</div>\n	</div>\n	<div class=\"review-body\">Gosto desse plugin, gratuito, simples, funcional e eficiente. serve ao propósito qual foi concebido. Show!</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"review\">\n	<div class=\"review-head\">\n		<div class=\"reviewer-info\">\n			<div class=\"review-title-section\">\n				<h4 class=\"review-title\">Perfect! The ONLY contact form!</h4>\n				<div class=\"star-rating\">\n				<div class=\"wporg-ratings\" aria-label=\"5 van de 5 sterren\" data-title-template=\"%s van de 5 sterren\" data-rating=\"5\" style=\"color:#ffb900;\"><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"></span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"></span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"></span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"></span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"></span></div>				</div>\n			</div>\n			<p class=\"reviewer\">\n				Door <a href=\"https://profiles.wordpress.org/xetouko/\"><img alt=\'\' src=\'https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/ea2a15c4643a7ff5046d7d852459c809?s=16&#038;d=monsterid&#038;r=g\' srcset=\'https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/ea2a15c4643a7ff5046d7d852459c809?s=32&#038;d=monsterid&#038;r=g 2x\' class=\'avatar avatar-16 photo\' height=\'16\' width=\'16\' loading=\'lazy\'/></a><a href=\"https://profiles.wordpress.org/xetouko/\" class=\"reviewer-name\">xetouko</a> op <span class=\"review-date\">december 2, 2021</span>			</p>\n		</div>\n	</div>\n	<div class=\"review-body\">Amazing plugin! Works great! This is amazing! Truly one of the most powerful and useful plugins out there. Absolutely necessary for every website! Plenty of options.\nThanks so much for creating this!</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"review\">\n	<div class=\"review-head\">\n		<div class=\"reviewer-info\">\n			<div class=\"review-title-section\">\n				<h4 class=\"review-title\">Need to integrate with payment gateway</h4>\n				<div class=\"star-rating\">\n				<div class=\"wporg-ratings\" aria-label=\"5 van de 5 sterren\" data-title-template=\"%s van de 5 sterren\" data-rating=\"5\" style=\"color:#ffb900;\"><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"></span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"></span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"></span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"></span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"></span></div>				</div>\n			</div>\n			<p class=\"reviewer\">\n				Door <a href=\"https://profiles.wordpress.org/abhisekbose99/\"><img alt=\'\' src=\'https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/8c105782cb7db31b59207e112f3f2beb?s=16&#038;d=monsterid&#038;r=g\' srcset=\'https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/8c105782cb7db31b59207e112f3f2beb?s=32&#038;d=monsterid&#038;r=g 2x\' class=\'avatar avatar-16 photo\' height=\'16\' width=\'16\' loading=\'lazy\'/></a><a href=\"https://profiles.wordpress.org/abhisekbose99/\" class=\"reviewer-name\">abhisekbose99</a> op <span class=\"review-date\">november 23, 2021</span>			</p>\n		</div>\n	</div>\n	<div class=\"review-body\">This plugin has made history in Wordpress age. Now if it brings any add-ons or scope to integrate with various payment gateway, it\'ll be very helpful for us.    </div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"review\">\n	<div class=\"review-head\">\n		<div class=\"reviewer-info\">\n			<div class=\"review-title-section\">\n				<h4 class=\"review-title\">Really Awesome Love It</h4>\n				<div class=\"star-rating\">\n				<div class=\"wporg-ratings\" aria-label=\"5 van de 5 sterren\" data-title-template=\"%s van de 5 sterren\" data-rating=\"5\" style=\"color:#ffb900;\"><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"></span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"></span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"></span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"></span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"></span></div>				</div>\n			</div>\n			<p class=\"reviewer\">\n				Door <a href=\"https://profiles.wordpress.org/onlinedevelopments/\"><img alt=\'\' src=\'https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/e82a9e09dcb1d42f6756f02337d2ef73?s=16&#038;d=monsterid&#038;r=g\' srcset=\'https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/e82a9e09dcb1d42f6756f02337d2ef73?s=32&#038;d=monsterid&#038;r=g 2x\' class=\'avatar avatar-16 photo\' height=\'16\' width=\'16\' loading=\'lazy\'/></a><a href=\"https://profiles.wordpress.org/onlinedevelopments/\" class=\"reviewer-name\">onlinedevelopments</a> op <span class=\"review-date\">november 14, 2021</span>			</p>\n		</div>\n	</div>\n	<div class=\"review-body\">What a relief to have found a plugin that works seamless first time within five minutes of activation. It is so easy to use and really awesome. \n\nIf there is anything that is free that works seamlessly then this is one of those plugins that deserve a donation. \n\nThanks very much i once again have faith in WordPress. Please continue with your awesomeness, you are a blessing to many.</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"review\">\n	<div class=\"review-head\">\n		<div class=\"reviewer-info\">\n			<div class=\"review-title-section\">\n				<h4 class=\"review-title\">Great plugin</h4>\n				<div class=\"star-rating\">\n				<div class=\"wporg-ratings\" aria-label=\"5 van de 5 sterren\" data-title-template=\"%s van de 5 sterren\" data-rating=\"5\" style=\"color:#ffb900;\"><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"></span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"></span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"></span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"></span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"></span></div>				</div>\n			</div>\n			<p class=\"reviewer\">\n				Door <a href=\"https://profiles.wordpress.org/manhphucofficial/\"><img alt=\'\' src=\'https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/a69dfc9ce00d25f3ba41b9550c301c64?s=16&#038;d=monsterid&#038;r=g\' srcset=\'https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/a69dfc9ce00d25f3ba41b9550c301c64?s=32&#038;d=monsterid&#038;r=g 2x\' class=\'avatar avatar-16 photo\' height=\'16\' width=\'16\' loading=\'lazy\'/></a><a href=\"https://profiles.wordpress.org/manhphucofficial/\" class=\"reviewer-name\">Phuc Nguyen <small>(manhphucofficial)</small></a> op <span class=\"review-date\">november 3, 2021</span>			</p>\n		</div>\n	</div>\n	<div class=\"review-body\">This is very simple but very effective forms solution! I like it very much!</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"review\">\n	<div class=\"review-head\">\n		<div class=\"reviewer-info\">\n			<div class=\"review-title-section\">\n				<h4 class=\"review-title\">The true classic, works perfectly</h4>\n				<div class=\"star-rating\">\n				<div class=\"wporg-ratings\" aria-label=\"5 van de 5 sterren\" data-title-template=\"%s van de 5 sterren\" data-rating=\"5\" style=\"color:#ffb900;\"><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"></span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"></span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"></span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"></span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"></span></div>				</div>\n			</div>\n			<p class=\"reviewer\">\n				Door <a href=\"https://profiles.wordpress.org/rodoswebdesign/\"><img alt=\'\' src=\'https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/1a2571eb7d19fa232a4fd0bc390d5c8b?s=16&#038;d=monsterid&#038;r=g\' srcset=\'https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/1a2571eb7d19fa232a4fd0bc390d5c8b?s=32&#038;d=monsterid&#038;r=g 2x\' class=\'avatar avatar-16 photo\' height=\'16\' width=\'16\' loading=\'lazy\'/></a><a href=\"https://profiles.wordpress.org/rodoswebdesign/\" class=\"reviewer-name\">George X. <small>(rodoswebdesign)</small></a> op <span class=\"review-date\">november 3, 2021</span>			</p>\n		</div>\n	</div>\n	<div class=\"review-body\">I really don\'t understand why so many 1 star reviews. The form has so many features that have to be paid for in other forms. \n\nYes, it\'s not as easy to use as others, but it\'s still one of the lightest and always working forms for wordpress.</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"review\">\n	<div class=\"review-head\">\n		<div class=\"reviewer-info\">\n			<div class=\"review-title-section\">\n				<h4 class=\"review-title\">Works Pretty well</h4>\n				<div class=\"star-rating\">\n				<div class=\"wporg-ratings\" aria-label=\"5 van de 5 sterren\" data-title-template=\"%s van de 5 sterren\" data-rating=\"5\" style=\"color:#ffb900;\"><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"></span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"></span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"></span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"></span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"></span></div>				</div>\n			</div>\n			<p class=\"reviewer\">\n				Door <a href=\"https://profiles.wordpress.org/seandmorris/\"><img alt=\'\' src=\'https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/d1cc452a5b2cc2b49add93b8abd0e4a9?s=16&#038;d=monsterid&#038;r=g\' srcset=\'https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/d1cc452a5b2cc2b49add93b8abd0e4a9?s=32&#038;d=monsterid&#038;r=g 2x\' class=\'avatar avatar-16 photo\' height=\'16\' width=\'16\' loading=\'lazy\'/></a><a href=\"https://profiles.wordpress.org/seandmorris/\" class=\"reviewer-name\">seandmorris</a> op <span class=\"review-date\">november 1, 2021</span>			</p>\n		</div>\n	</div>\n	<div class=\"review-body\">I had a bit of frustration in the beginning, mostly because of my newness in the field, but I was able to add my flair to the contact form. </div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"review\">\n	<div class=\"review-head\">\n		<div class=\"reviewer-info\">\n			<div class=\"review-title-section\">\n				<h4 class=\"review-title\">It&#039;s good when it&#039;s working, but not if you need support</h4>\n				<div class=\"star-rating\">\n				<div class=\"wporg-ratings\" aria-label=\"2 van de 5 sterren\" data-title-template=\"%s van de 5 sterren\" data-rating=\"2\" style=\"color:#ffb900;\"><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"></span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"></span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-empty\"></span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-empty\"></span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-empty\"></span></div>				</div>\n			</div>\n			<p class=\"reviewer\">\n				Door <a href=\"https://profiles.wordpress.org/sunlineenergy/\"><img alt=\'\' src=\'https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/9b33b0f47d05d3875f9c7a4915c3fb69?s=16&#038;d=monsterid&#038;r=g\' srcset=\'https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/9b33b0f47d05d3875f9c7a4915c3fb69?s=32&#038;d=monsterid&#038;r=g 2x\' class=\'avatar avatar-16 photo\' height=\'16\' width=\'16\' loading=\'lazy\'/></a><a href=\"https://profiles.wordpress.org/sunlineenergy/\" class=\"reviewer-name\">Sunline Energy <small>(sunlineenergy)</small></a> op <span class=\"review-date\">oktober 25, 2021</span>			</p>\n		</div>\n	</div>\n	<div class=\"review-body\">Once the plugin was updated to 5.4.2 I started having issues with the recaptcha v3. All the forms are being flagged as spam. I\'ve already submitted a ticket but the author stopped responding. I jumped on a thread that had the same issue and the plugin author stopped responding as well. \nOther than that the plugin generally works well. Just make sure you don\'t have an issue because their support is very poor. </div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"review\">\n	<div class=\"review-head\">\n		<div class=\"reviewer-info\">\n			<div class=\"review-title-section\">\n				<h4 class=\"review-title\">it doesn&#039;t work</h4>\n				<div class=\"star-rating\">\n				<div class=\"wporg-ratings\" aria-label=\"1 van de 5 sterren\" data-title-template=\"%s van de 5 sterren\" data-rating=\"1\" style=\"color:#ffb900;\"><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"></span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-empty\"></span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-empty\"></span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-empty\"></span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-empty\"></span></div>				</div>\n			</div>\n			<p class=\"reviewer\">\n				Door <a href=\"https://profiles.wordpress.org/alexg79/\"><img alt=\'\' src=\'https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/aeb8dfe5868aea7d738cc1bdc95d9cda?s=16&#038;d=monsterid&#038;r=g\' srcset=\'https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/aeb8dfe5868aea7d738cc1bdc95d9cda?s=32&#038;d=monsterid&#038;r=g 2x\' class=\'avatar avatar-16 photo\' height=\'16\' width=\'16\' loading=\'lazy\'/></a><a href=\"https://profiles.wordpress.org/alexg79/\" class=\"reviewer-name\">alexg79</a> op <span class=\"review-date\">oktober 25, 2021</span>			</p>\n		</div>\n	</div>\n	<div class=\"review-body\">I have just downloaded and integrated it with my Mailchimp list but when I Have tested it by signing in as a user on my contact web page it keeps saying : \n\"There has been some error while submitting the form. Please verify all form fields again.\"\nPlease let me know if I can solve this issue.\nThanks in advance !\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"review\">\n	<div class=\"review-head\">\n		<div class=\"reviewer-info\">\n			<div class=\"review-title-section\">\n				<h4 class=\"review-title\">White page on 5.5</h4>\n				<div class=\"star-rating\">\n				<div class=\"wporg-ratings\" aria-label=\"5 van de 5 sterren\" data-title-template=\"%s van de 5 sterren\" data-rating=\"5\" style=\"color:#ffb900;\"><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"></span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"></span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"></span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"></span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"></span></div>				</div>\n			</div>\n			<p class=\"reviewer\">\n				Door <a href=\"https://profiles.wordpress.org/deegee65/\"><img alt=\'\' src=\'https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/d417b15caebb449083cf33a19975e9da?s=16&#038;d=monsterid&#038;r=g\' srcset=\'https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/d417b15caebb449083cf33a19975e9da?s=32&#038;d=monsterid&#038;r=g 2x\' class=\'avatar avatar-16 photo\' height=\'16\' width=\'16\' loading=\'lazy\'/></a><a href=\"https://profiles.wordpress.org/deegee65/\" class=\"reviewer-name\">deegee65</a> op <span class=\"review-date\">oktober 11, 2021</span>			</p>\n		</div>\n	</div>\n	<div class=\"review-body\">I try to view the contact modules but i receive white page.\nPhp 8 - Latest WP</div>\n</div>\n\";}s:13:\"download_link\";s:63:\"https://downloads.wordpress.org/plugin/contact-form-7.5.5.3.zip\";s:11:\"screenshots\";a:1:{i:1;a:2:{s:3:\"src\";s:67:\"https://ps.w.org/contact-form-7/assets/screenshot-1.png?rev=1176454\";s:7:\"caption\";s:16:\"screenshot-1.png\";}}s:4:\"tags\";a:5:{s:7:\"contact\";s:7:\"contact\