tu; font-weight: 500;\" data-fusion-font=\"true\" data-fusion-google-font=\"Ubuntu\" data-fusion-google-variant=\"500\">\'\'Er staan van ons honderden pompen in Nederland en wisten niet of de installaties wel goed werkt. Nu krijgen wij een seintje via SMS of email wanneer er niet meer gepompt wordt en kunnen wij direct actie ondernemen, bespaart ons veel tijd en dus geld.\'\'</span></p>\n<h5 data-fontsize=\"24\" style=\"--fontSize:24; line-height: 1.4;\" data-lineheight=\"33.6px\" class=\"fusion-responsive-typography-calculated\"></h5>[/fusion_text][/fusion_builder_column][fusion_builder_column type=\"1_2\" type=\"1_2\" layout=\"1_2\" align_self=\"auto\" content_layout=\"column\" align_content=\"flex-start\" valign_content=\"flex-start\" content_wrap=\"wrap\" center_content=\"no\" target=\"_self\" hide_on_mobile=\"small-visibility,medium-visibility,large-visibility\" sticky_display=\"normal,sticky\" order_medium=\"0\" order_small=\"0\" hover_type=\"none\" border_style=\"solid\" box_shadow=\"no\" box_shadow_blur=\"0\" box_shadow_spread=\"0\" background_type=\"single\" gradient_start_position=\"0\" gradient_end_position=\"100\" gradient_type=\"linear\" radial_direction=\"center center\" linear_angle=\"180\" background_color=\"#f49200\" background_position=\"left top\" background_repeat=\"no-repeat\" background_blend_mode=\"none\" filter_type=\"regular\" filter_hue=\"0\" filter_saturation=\"100\" filter_brightness=\"100\" filter_contrast=\"100\" filter_invert=\"0\" filter_sepia=\"0\" filter_opacity=\"100\" filter_blur=\"0\" filter_hue_hover=\"0\" filter_saturation_hover=\"100\" filter_brightness_hover=\"100\" filter_contrast_hover=\"100\" filter_invert_hover=\"0\" filter_sepia_hover=\"0\" filter_opacity_hover=\"100\" filter_blur_hover=\"0\" animation_direction=\"left\" animation_speed=\"0.3\" last=\"true\" border_position=\"all\" first=\"false\" min_height=\"\" link=\"\"][fusion_text rule_style=\"default\" hide_on_mobile=\"small-visibility,medium-visibility,large-visibility\" sticky_display=\"normal,sticky\" margin_top=\"20px\" margin_right=\"20px\" margin_bottom=\"20px\" margin_left=\"20px\" text_transform=\"none\" animation_direction=\"left\" animation_speed=\"0.3\"]\r\n<p><span style=\"color: #ffffff;\">\'\' Ons bedrijf hebben veel toegangsdeuren die nog niet op afstand te monitoren zijn. Door gebruik te maken van het Salland Electronics ThingsWay platform is dat wel mogelijk. Binnen een week was de eerste deur connected. De service afdeling werkt nu veel efficiënter en wij weten nu veel meer  van de gebruiker.\'\'</span></p>\r\n[/fusion_text][/fusion_builder_column][fusion_builder_column type=\"1_2\" type=\"1_2\" layout=\"1_2\" align_self=\"auto\" content_layout=\"column\" align_content=\"flex-start\" valign_content=\"flex-start\" content_wrap=\"wrap\" center_content=\"no\" target=\"_self\" hide_on_mobile=\"small-visibility,medium-visibility,large-visibility\" sticky_display=\"normal,sticky\" order_medium=\"0\" order_small=\"0\" hover_type=\"none\" border_style=\"solid\" box_shadow=\"no\" box_shadow_blur=\"0\" box_shadow_spread=\"0\" background_type=\"single\" gradient_start_position=\"0\" gradient_end_position=\"100\" gradient_type=\"linear\" radial_direction=\"center center\" linear_angle=\"180\" background_color=\"#f49200\" background_position=\"left top\" background_repeat=\"no-repeat\" background_blend_mode=\"none\" filter_type=\"regular\" filter_hue=\"0\" filter_saturation=\"100\" filter_brightness=\"100\" filter_contrast=\"100\" filter_invert=\"0\" filter_sepia=\"0\" filter_opacity=\"100\" filter_blur=\"0\" filter_hue_hover=\"0\" filter_saturation_hover=\"100\" filter_brightness_hover=\"100\" filter_contrast_hover=\"100\" filter_invert_hover=\"0\" filter_sepia_hover=\"0\" filter_opacity_hover=\"100\" filter_blur_hover=\"0\" animation_direction=\"left\" animation_speed=\"0.3\" last=\"false\" border_position=\"all\" first=\"true\" min_height=\"\" link=\"\"][fusion_text rule_style=\"default\" hide_on_mobile=\"small-visibility,medium-visibility,large-visibility\" sticky_display=\"normal,sticky\" margin_top=\"20px\" margin_right=\"20px\" margin_bottom=\"20px\" margin_left=\"20px\" text_transform=\"none\" animation_direction=\"left\" animation_speed=\"0.3\"]\r\n<p><span style=\"color: #ffffff;\">\'\' Wij zetten in op IoT technologie om ons bedrijf te internationaliseren. Wij weten veel van onderhoud van daken, maar met het ThingsWay platform weten wij nu echt wat er gebeurt en kunnen aan predictive maintenance beginnen. Wij lopen hiermee ver voor op de internationale concurrentie met onze slimme dakgoot.\'\'</span></p>\r\n[/fusion_text][/fusion_builder_column][fusion_builder_column type=\"1_2\" type=\"1_2\" layout=\"1_2\" align_self=\"auto\" content_layout=\"column\" align_content=\"flex-start\" valign_content=\"flex-start\" content_wrap=\"wrap\" center_content=\"no\" target=\"_self\" hide_on_mobile=\"small-visibility,medium-visibility,large-visibility\" sticky_display=\"normal,sticky\" order_medium=\"0\" order_small=\"0\" hover_type=\"none\" border_style=\"solid\" box_shadow=\"no\" box_shadow_blur=\"0\" box_shadow_spread=\"0\" background_type=\"single\" gradient_start_position=\"0\" gradient_end_position=\"100\" gradient_type=\"linear\" radial_direction=\"center center\" linear_angle=\"180\" background_color=\"#003b7f\" background_position=\"left top\" background_repeat=\"no-repeat\" background_blend_mode=\"none\" filter_type=\"regular\" filter_hue=\"0\" filter_saturation=\"100\" filter_brightness=\"100\" filter_contrast=\"100\" filter_invert=\"0\" filter_sepia=\"0\" filter_opacity=\"100\" filter_blur=\"0\" filter_hue_hover=\"0\" filter_saturation_hover=\"100\" filter_brightness_hover=\"100\" filter_contrast_hover=\"100\" filter_invert_hover=\"0\" filter_sepia_hover=\"0\" filter_opacity_hover=\"100\" filter_blur_hover=\"0\" animation_direction=\"left\" animation_speed=\"0.3\" last=\"true\" border_position=\"all\" first=\"false\" min_height=\"\" link=\"\"][fusion_text rule_style=\"default\" hide_on_mobile=\"small-visibility,medium-visibility,large-visibility\" sticky_display=\"normal,sticky\" margin_top=\"20px\" margin_right=\"20px\" margin_bottom=\"20px\" margin_left=\"20px\" text_transform=\"none\" animation_direction=\"left\" animation_speed=\"0.3\"]\r\n<p><span style=\"color: #ffffff;\">\'\' Wij werken al jaren naar alle tevredenheid met Salland samen. Onze containers worden al meer dan 15 jaar online gemonitoord. Tegenwoordig met de modernste communicatie mogelijkheden, cloud omgeving en app’s.\'\'</span></p>\r\n[/fusion_text][/fusion_builder_column][/fusion_builder_row][/fusion_builder_container]','Homepagina','','inherit','closed','closed','','2-revision-v1','','','2022-01-13 14:23:30','2022-01-13 14:23:30','',2,'https://thingsway.media2netdev.nl/?p=151',0,'revision','',0),(152,1,'2022-01-13 15:20:47','2022-01-13 15:20:47','[fusion_builder_container type=\"flex\" hundred_percent=\"no\" hundred_percent_height=\"min\" min_height=\"500px\" hundred_percent_height_scroll=\"no\" align_content=\"stretch\" flex_align_items=\"stretch\" flex_justify_content=\"center\" hundred_percent_height_center_content=\"yes\" equal_height_columns=\"no\" container_tag=\"div\" hide_on_mobile=\"small-visibility,medium-visibility,large-visibility\" status=\"published\" margin_top=\"-60px\" border_style=\"solid\" box_shadow=\"no\" box_shadow_blur=\"0\" box_shadow_spread=\"0\" gradient_start_color=\"#000000\" gradient_end_color=\"rgba(0,0,0,0.3)\" gradient_start_position=\"0\" gradient_end_position=\"100\" gradient_type=\"linear\" radial_direction=\"center center\" linear_angle=\"180\" background_image=\"https://thingsway.nl/wp-content/uploads/2021/12/2327-iot.webp\" background_position=\"center center\" background_repeat=\"no-repeat\" fade=\"no\" background_parallax=\"none\" enable_mobile=\"no\" parallax_speed=\"0.3\" background_blend_mode=\"none\" video_aspect_ratio=\"16:9\" video_loop=\"yes\" video_mute=\"yes\" absolute=\"off\" absolute_devices=\"small,medium,large