lor=\"\" animation_type=\"\" animation_direction=\"left\" animation_speed=\"0.3\" animation_offset=\"\"]\r\n<h3>Cloud omgeving</h3>\r\nNaast de connectivity partner werken wij samen met de firma Docksters voor data verwerking in een cloud omgeving. Via een web interface of app is snel inzicht te krijgen van de data. Dor het instellen van grenswaarden kunnen automatisch berichten gestuurd worden bij uitval of bereiken van een bepaalde limiet voor bijvoorbeeld het inplannen van onderhoud.\r\n\r\n[/fusion_text][fusion_checklist icon=\"fa-check-circle fas\" iconcolor=\"\" circle=\"\" circlecolor=\"\" textcolor=\"\" size=\"\" item_padding_top=\"\" item_padding_right=\"\" item_padding_bottom=\"\" item_padding_left=\"\" divider=\"\" divider_color=\"\" odd_row_bgcolor=\"\" even_row_bgcolor=\"\" hide_on_mobile=\"small-visibility,medium-visibility,large-visibility\" class=\"\" id=\"\"][fusion_li_item icon=\"\"]Lage investeringsdrempel[/fusion_li_item][fusion_li_item icon=\"\"]Weergave via web interface of APP[/fusion_li_item][fusion_li_item icon=\"\"]Instelbare drempelwaarde voor automatische signalering[/fusion_li_item][/fusion_checklist][/fusion_builder_column][fusion_builder_column type=\"1_2\" layout=\"1_2\" align_self=\"center\" content_layout=\"column\" align_content=\"center\" valign_content=\"flex-start\" content_wrap=\"wrap\" spacing=\"\" center_content=\"no\" link=\"\" target=\"_self\" link_description=\"\" min_height=\"\" hide_on_mobile=\"small-visibility,medium-visibility,large-visibility\" sticky_display=\"normal,sticky\" class=\"\" id=\"\" background_image_id=\"\" type_medium=\"\" type_small=\"\" order_medium=\"0\" order_small=\"0\" spacing_left_medium=\"\" spacing_right_medium=\"\" spacing_left_small=\"\" spacing_right_small=\"\" spacing_left=\"\" spacing_right=\"\" margin_top_medium=\"\" margin_bottom_medium=\"\" margin_top_small=\"\" margin_bottom_small=\"\" margin_top=\"\" margin_bottom=\"\" padding_top_medium=\"\" padding_right_medium=\"\" padding_bottom_me